<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria sells $31.1 million at weekly fx auction.</title>
<headline>Nigeria sells $31.1 million at weekly fx auction.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's central bank on Friday announced sales of forex at its latest weekly auction held on Thursday, July 24</p>
<p>					  24 July		17 July</p>
<p>    Amount sold		  $31.106 million	  $24.614 million</p>
<p>    Dollar exchange rate     83.20 naira	  83.50 naira</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 2630317</p>
</text>
